# Copy to .env.local and fill in your real values.
#
# ⚠️ NEXT_PUBLIC_* values are INLINED INTO THE BROWSER BUNDLE at build time.
# Anything with that prefix is public — treat it as if it were printed on the
# homepage, because effectively it is. This bit us: the ERP webhook secret was
# shipped as NEXT_PUBLIC_WEBHOOK_SECRET and sat readable in the deployed
# JavaScript for 44 days. Never put a credential behind that prefix.

# ── Lead capture (server-only — NOT exposed to the browser) ──────────────────
# Used by app/api/leads/route.ts, which relays the "Find a dealer" form to the
# ERP server-to-server. Without the NEXT_PUBLIC_ prefix these stay on the
# server, which is the entire point.
ERP_LEADS_ENDPOINT=https://erp.pgak.co.in/api/leads/inbound
ERP_WEBHOOK_SECRET=replace-with-the-rotated-webhook-secret

# ── Lead alerting (server-only, STRONGLY recommended) ────────────────────────
# Where a lead goes when the ERP will not take it. Without these, an
# undelivered lead exists only in a Vercel function log, which is retained
# about an hour on Hobby — so if the customer walks away, the lead is gone.
# With them, it lands on the owner's phone immediately.
#
# Setup: message @BotFather on Telegram -> /newbot -> copy the token. Then
# message your new bot once and open
# https://api.telegram.org/bot<TOKEN>/getUpdates to read your chat id.
#
# ⚠️ This sends the customer's name and phone number to Telegram, which makes
# Telegram a data processor for your leads. That is a deliberate choice, which
# is why it is opt-in rather than baked in.
LEAD_ALERT_TELEGRAM_TOKEN=
LEAD_ALERT_TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID=

# ── Live view (public by design — this one is just an API base URL) ──────────
NEXT_PUBLIC_PGAK_API=https://cloud.pgak.co.in/api/v1

# ── New-lead alert (server-only) ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# Every DELIVERED lead is also pushed to the Telegram bot above the moment it
# lands, so it can be phoned within the hour the thank-you screen now promises.
# On by default whenever the bot is configured; set to 0 to keep only the
# failure alerts.
# LEAD_ALERT_NEW_LEADS=1

# ── Booking link (public by design) ──────────────────────────────────────────
# Optional. A Google Calendar appointment page or Cal.com link. When set, the
# thank-you screen offers "Pick a 15-minute slot" beside the WhatsApp button.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_BOOKING_URL=

# ── Optional analytics ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Microsoft Clarity session recordings + heatmaps (free). Wired in
# app/layout.tsx; loads only when this is set, so local and preview builds
# stay out of the data. Create the project at clarity.microsoft.com.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_CLARITY_ID=
